{"product_id":"les-miserables-volume-2","title":"Les Miserables Volume 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eLes Miserables Volume 2With an Introduction and Notes by Roger Clark, University of Kent at CanterburyOne of the great Classics of Western Literature, Les Miserables is a magisterial work which is rich in both character portrayal and meticulous historical description. Characters such as the absurdly criminalised Valjean, the street urchin Gavroche, the rascal Thenardier, the implacable detective Javert, and the pitiful figure of the prostitute Fantine and her daughter Cosette, have entered the pantheon of literary dramatis personae.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 192\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Victor Hugo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781853260506\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Unknown Binding\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45696224985241,"sku":"2RA9781853260506","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68b85f8620c5e_Les_Miserables_Volume_2_Victor_Hugo.jpg?v=1756998334","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/les-miserables-volume-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}